# LaunchLoop needs NO environment variables that you set by hand.
#
# Secrets and platform URLs are managed by the DeepSpace CLI:
#   - `npx deepspace dev start` writes a local `.dev.vars` file (git-ignored)
#     containing a short-lived owner token and the platform URLs.
#   - `npx deepspace deploy` mints the production credentials on the platform.
#   - To add your own secret later: `npx deepspace secrets set NAME`
#
# NEVER commit `.dev.vars`, `~/.deepspace/session`, or any real key.
# Nothing in this repository contains a credential.
